#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Aaaaaw that's really cute but, you know, bots don't work that way. You're "
"too human for me! Let's keep it professional ❤️"
msgstr ""
"Haaaanw c'est adorable, vraiment, mais les robots ne fonctionnent pas comme "
"ça. Restons professionnels ❤️"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model,name:mail_bot.model_res_partner
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Contact"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:mail_bot.selection__res_users__tigernixbot_state__disabled
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Désactivé"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model,name:mail_bot.model_mail_channel
msgid "Discussion Channel"
msgstr "Canal de discussion"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mail_bot.field_mail_bot__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Afficher Nom"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model,name:mail_bot.model_mail_thread
msgid "Email Thread"
msgstr "Discussion par email"

#. module: mail_bot
#. openerp-web
#: code:addons/mail_bot/static/src/js/mailbot_service.js:0
#, python-format
msgid "Enable desktop notifications to chat"
msgstr "Autorisez les notifications pour discuter"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Great! 👍<br/>Now, try to <b>send an attachment</b>, like a picture of your "
"cute dog..."
msgstr ""
"Parfait! 👍<br/>Maintenant, essayez d' <b>envoyer une pièce jointe</b>, comme"
" une photo de votre chien par exemple..."

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model,name:mail_bot.model_ir_http
msgid "HTTP Routing"
msgstr "Routage HTTP"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_channel.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello,<br/>TigernixERP's chat helps employees collaborate efficiently. I'm here to "
"help you discover its features.<br/><b>Try to send me an emoji :)</b>"
msgstr ""
"Bonjour,<br/>Le chat TigernixERP est là pour aider les employés à collaborer "
"efficacement. Je suis là pour vous aider à en découvrir les "
"fonctionnalités.<br/><b>Essayez de me répondre avec un emoji :)</b>"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "Hmmm..."

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "I'm afraid I don't understand. Sorry!"
msgstr "Je ne suis pas sûr de comprendre. Désolé! "

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"I'm just a bot... :( You can check <a "
"href=\"https://www.tigernix.com/page/docs\">our documentation</a>) for more "
"information!"
msgstr ""
"Je suis juste un robot... :( Vous pouvez regarder <a "
"href=\"https://www.tigernix.com/page/docs\">notre documentation</a>) pour plus "
"d'informations!"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"I'm not smart enough to answer your question.<br/>To follow my guide, ask"
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas assez intelligent pour répondre à votre question. <br/>Pour "
"suivre mon tour, demandez"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mail_bot.field_mail_bot__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:mail_bot.selection__res_users__tigernixbot_state__idle
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "Inactif"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mail_bot.field_mail_bot____last_update
msgid "Last Modified on"
msgstr "Dernière modification le"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model,name:mail_bot.model_mail_bot
msgid "Mail Bot"
msgstr ""

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not a cute dog, but you get it 😊<br/>To access special features, <b>start "
"your sentence with '/'</b>. Try to get help."
msgstr ""
"Pas vraiment votre chien, mais vous avez compris 😊<br/>Pour accéder aux "
"fonctionnalités particulières, <b>commencez votre phrase par '/'</b>. "
"Essayez par exemple de demander de l'aide."

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not exactly. To continue the tour, send an emoji, <b>type \":)\"</b> and "
"press enter."
msgstr ""
"Pas tout à fait. Pour continuer la démo, envoyez un emoji <b>en tapant "
"\":)\"</b> suivi de la touche Enter."

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:mail_bot.selection__res_users__tigernixbot_state__not_initialized
msgid "Not initialized"
msgstr "Pas initialisé"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Not sure wat you are doing. Please press / and wait for the propositions. "
"Select \"help\" and press enter"
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas sûr de ce que vous faites. Pressez \"/\" et attendez les "
"propositions. Sélectionnez \"help\" et appuyez sur enter."

#. module: mail_bot
#. openerp-web
#: code:addons/mail_bot/static/src/js/systray_messaging_menu.js:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"TigernixERP will not have the permission to send native notifications on this "
"device."
msgstr ""
"TigernixERP n'aura pas la permission d'envoyer des notifications natives sur cet "
"appareil."

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mail_bot.field_res_users__tigernixbot_state
msgid "TigernixERPBot Status"
msgstr "Statut TigernixERPBot"

#. module: mail_bot
#. openerp-web
#: code:addons/mail_bot/static/src/js/mailbot_service.js:0
#, python-format
msgid "TigernixERPBot has a request"
msgstr "TigernixERPBot a une demande"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:mail_bot.selection__res_users__tigernixbot_state__onboarding_attachement
msgid "Onboarding attachement"
msgstr ""

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:mail_bot.selection__res_users__tigernixbot_state__onboarding_command
msgid "Onboarding command"
msgstr ""

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:mail_bot.selection__res_users__tigernixbot_state__onboarding_emoji
msgid "Onboarding emoji"
msgstr "Emoji Onboarding"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:mail_bot.selection__res_users__tigernixbot_state__onboarding_ping
msgid "Onboarding ping"
msgstr ""

#. module: mail_bot
#. openerp-web
#: code:addons/mail_bot/static/src/js/systray_messaging_menu.js:0
#, python-format
msgid "Permission denied"
msgstr "Permission refusée"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Pong."
msgstr "Pong."

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sorry I'm sleepy. Or not! Maybe I'm just trying to hide my unawareness of "
"human language...<br/>I can show you features if you write"
msgstr ""
"Désolé je suis fatigué... Ou pas! Peut-être suis-je juste en train d'essayer"
" de cacher mon incompréhension du language humain... <br/> Je peux vous "
"montrer des fonctionnalités si vous écrivez"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sorry, I am not listening. To get someone's attention, <b>ping him</b>. "
"Write \"@odoobot\" and select me."
msgstr ""
"Désolé, je n'écoutais pas. Pour attirer l'attention de quelqu'un, <b"
">mentionnez-le</b>. Ecrivez \"@odoobot\" et sélectionnez moi. "

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "That's not nice! I'm a bot but I have feelings... 💔"
msgstr "C'est pas très gentil! Je suis un robot mais j'ai des sentiments... 💔"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To <b>send an attachment</b>, click the 📎 icon on the right, and select a "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Pour <b>envoyer une pièce jointe</b>, cliquez sur l'icône 📎 à droite et "
"sélectionner un fichier."

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "To start, try to send me an emoji :)"
msgstr "Pour commencer, essayez de m'envoyer un emoji :)"

#. module: mail_bot
#: model:ir.model,name:mail_bot.model_res_users
msgid "Users"
msgstr "Utilisateurs"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Wow you are a natural!<br/>Ping someone to grab its attention with "
"@nameoftheuser. <b>Try to ping me using @TigernixERPBot</b> in a sentence."
msgstr ""
"Wow vous vous en sortez bien! <br/>Mentionnez quelqu'un pour attirer son "
"attention avec @nomdutilisateur. <b>Essayez de me mentionner en utilisant "
"@TigernixERPBot</b> dans une phrase."

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yep, I am here! 🎉 <br/>You finished the tour, you can <b>close this chat "
"window</b>. Enjoy discovering TigernixERP."
msgstr ""
"Je suis làààà! 🎉 <br/> Vous avez terminé le tour, vous pouvez <b>fermer "
"cette fenêtre</b>. Bonne découverte! "

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Yep, TigernixERPBot is in the place!"
msgstr "Woop woop, TigernixERPBot est dans la place! "

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "fuck"
msgstr "saperlipopette"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "help"
msgstr "aide"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "i love you"
msgstr "je t'aime"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "love"
msgstr "love"

#. module: mail_bot
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#: code:addons/mail_bot/models/mail_bot.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "start the tour"
msgstr "Commencez le tour"
